# A functionally correct but late result: only a_latency (and a_valid_def) can see it; the scoreboard is silent.
id: M20
desc: one-cycle bubble before a pushed result becomes visible (out_valid delayed a cycle)
intended: a_latency
edit: rtl/alu_fifo_top.sv
  find: assign out_valid = !out_empty;
  replace: logic ov_d;\n  always_ff @(posedge clk) ov_d <= !out_empty;\n  assign out_valid = !out_empty && ov_d;
